stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> NONE
  NONE --> REQUESTED: customer opens return/dispute
  REQUESTED --> EVIDENCE_PENDING: admin requests evidence
  REQUESTED --> UNDER_REVIEW: supplier responds
  EVIDENCE_PENDING --> UNDER_REVIEW: evidence submitted or deadline passes
  UNDER_REVIEW --> APPROVED: supplier/admin approves
  UNDER_REVIEW --> REJECTED: supplier/admin rejects
  APPROVED --> RETURN_IN_TRANSIT: customer ships return
  RETURN_IN_TRANSIT --> RECEIVED: supplier confirms receipt
  RECEIVED --> REFUND_PENDING: refund instruction created
  REFUND_PENDING --> REFUNDED: payment completed
  REJECTED --> CLOSED
  REFUNDED --> CLOSED
  CLOSED --> [*]
